{
  "name": "fastvideo-fasth3-i2v",
  "workflow": "video_fastvideo_fasth3_i2v.json",
  "description": "MiniMax-H3 + FastVideo FastH3 8-Step V2（DMD2 蒸馏）图生视频（fl2va）：首帧（可选尾帧）→ 视频 + 同步音频。画幅由输入图决定（ImageScaleToTotalPixels → GetImageSize），时长按 17k+5 帧栅格吸附到 24fps。",
